# GuitarFreaks Ver 1.01 (GQ886 VER. JAD): a game, from the NVRAM gtrfrksj-install.his leaves (the
# flash installed). Power-on: FLASH-ROM CHECK (to frame ~2600), then attract; two coins, Start through the screens to
# the music select's default; the stage played with the guitar map: a neck button held and picked
# every 12 frames (R, G, B in turn), a wail every 240. Hashes the main RAM every frame, snapshots
# every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game gtrfrksj

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 3400 press "Coin 1" 8
at 3450 press "Coin 1" 8
at 3700 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 4000 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 4300 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 4600 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 4900 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 5200 every 36 press "P1 Button R" 8
from 5212 every 36 press "P1 Button G" 8
from 5224 every 36 press "P1 Button B" 8
from 5202 every 12 press "P1 Pick" 3
from 5206 every 240 press "P1 Wailing" 4
from 0 every 60 snap
at 12000 quit
